<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We are the sons, we are the sons,</l><l>Of the living God, of the living God.</l><l>We will rejoice, we will rejoice,</l><l>And be glad in Him, and be glad in Him.</l><l>We are the sons of the living God.</l><l>We will rejoice and be glad in Him.</l><l>We are the sons, we are the sons</l><l>Of the living God.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
